### Get all snippets
GET http://localhost:3000/api/snippets


### Get a snippet by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/snippets/4

### Create a new snippet
POST http://localhost:3000/api/snippets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test from VSCode",
  "code": "const add = (a, b) => a + b;",
  "language": "JavaScript"
}

